{"id": 1000615, "slug": "the-chefs-shift-2", "name": "The Chef's Shift", "name_original": "The Chef's Shift", "description": "<p>Get ready to cook up a storm in \"The Chef's Shift\" - a fast-paced typing game set in a bustling restaurant! With your keyboard as your weapon, you'll need to cook and serve delicious dishes to hungry customers before they lose their patience. But that's not all - you'll also need to juggle all kinds of crazy distractions, from rat invasions to unruly customers. </p><ul><li><p> 1 teaspoon of <strong>chaotic, fast-paced</strong> gameplay </p></li><li><p> 1 package of easy-to-pickup hard-to-master <strong>TYPING</strong> mechanic </p></li><li><p> 1 cup of fun <strong>time management</strong> bits </p></li></ul><p> </p><p>And we mean it! </p><ul><li><p> Navigate through the menu by typing </p></li><li><p> Prepare &amp; serve your customers by typing </p></li><li><p> Select your dialogue choices by typing </p></li></ul><p> </p><p>Embark on a culinary journey through 6 vibrant chapters, savoring the diverse flavors of cuisine all around the world, where each restaurant will represent different food culture, posing different quirks &amp; challenges.</p><p> </p><p>Throughout the game you will meet various characters, from customers with their own personality, to characters who propel the story forward. </p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-03-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-02-14T14:41:44", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/299/29911a9c1eea3ecdc8a349cc23e88896.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/018/018573c1bb9c10cae1439c5f23f727c6.jpg", "website": "https://panitiagamedev.carrd.co/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 50.0}, {"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 1, "percent": 50.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 6, "added_by_status": {"owned": 1, "beaten": 1, "toplay": 3, "dropp